  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Law and Order Trust Fund for Afghanistan (LOTFA) mobilizes strategic resources in support of development strategies that strengthen national justice and rule of law systems. Initiatives close existing gaps in the security and justice sectors of Afghanistan with a strong focus on anti-corruption.</narrative>
